  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ech_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Echo trails\n\nA star (Curve in `star` mode) spins twice a loop and swings round a Lissajous path: two LFOs, three and four swings a loop, give its x and y. Echo (`echo` mode) keeps the last frames on the GPU and draws ten earlier ones under it, three frames apart, each fainter.\n\nTry `trails` (a fading smear), `delay`, `slit-scan` (each row from a different moment) or `freeze`.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Echo trails\n\nA star (Curve in `star` mode) spins twice a loop and swings round a Lissajous path: two LFOs, three and four swings a loop, give its x and y. Echo (`echo` mode) keeps the last frames on the GPU and draws ten earlier ones under it, three frames apart, each fainter.\n\nTry `trails` (a fading smear), `delay`, `slit-scan` (each row from a different moment) or `freeze`.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
